<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 1.095 bln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 1.095 bln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 1.095 billion dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 162	     162		     8.50</p>
<p>    Five years     368	     368		     9.50</p>
<p>    10-years	 325	     325		    10.00</p>
<p>    15-years	 240	     240		    10.25</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   1.095	  1.095</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for June 3, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.38 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
